      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63882dc1f272550ad4b6b553|full_name} AFAIK, imposters are generated once on an avatar, and are not updated unless you go to the VRChat webpage for your avatar and re-generate impostors. They are fairly computationally expensive to calculate, and they are done server sided (rather than in the editor) so VRChat doesn't update it automatically.",
